{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Evolvania</i>\u00a0you embody a mysterious, wandering eye on a quest to seize  eyedrops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture deep into a colossal creature and discover the mysterious secrets it holds. Explore every corner and crevice hand-drawn with vivid, gruesome detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809560/extras/0d3fa4c20b6c04114dc3ebae9ad5db10.poster.avif?t=1761569552\" width=600 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809560/extras/0d3fa4c20b6c04114dc3ebae9ad5db10.webm?t=1761569552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809560/extras/0d3fa4c20b6c04114dc3ebae9ad5db10.mp4?t=1761569552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Haunting, Handcrafted World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a bizarre interior landscape of a colossal beast. Every dripping detail and splatter tells a story waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809560/extras/6c03529a6080acd4e52f5cc63ad938e9.poster.avif?t=1761569552\" width=600 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809560/extras/6c03529a6080acd4e52f5cc63ad938e9.webm?t=1761569552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809560/extras/6c03529a6080acd4e52f5cc63ad938e9.mp4?t=1761569552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Revolutionary Combat &amp; Fusion Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience classic 2D metroidvania action with a twist. Use the different <strong>combinations</strong> to experiment and unlock new gruesome abilities and passages within the game world. Evolve in something new: better, faster and stronger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809560/extras/63f77ecc2b58d5f0faf424fa4d426a0a.poster.avif?t=1761569552\" width=600 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809560/extras/63f77ecc2b58d5f0faf424fa4d426a0a.webm?t=1761569552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809560/extras/63f77ecc2b58d5f0faf424fa4d426a0a.mp4?t=1761569552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diverse and Thrilling Foes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a range of enemies, each with its own unique challenge. Learn their secrets, adapt your strategies, and use their traits to your advantage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What's in the demo</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two biomes: one complete and a glimpse of the second</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One boss</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 fusion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 10 secrets. Can you find them all?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3809560?t=1761569552","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3809560?t=1761569552","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809560/50db938164246ecef951bb99b426435749d41ffb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761569552","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809560/50db938164246ecef951bb99b426435749d41ffb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761569552","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Evolvania</i>\u00a0you embody a mysterious, wandering eye on a quest to seize  eyedrops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture deep into a colossal creature and discover the mysterious secrets it holds. Explore every corner and crevice hand-drawn with vivid, gruesome detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809560/extras/0d3fa4c20b6c04114dc3ebae9ad5db10.poster.avif?t=1761569552\" width=600 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809560/extras/0d3fa4c20b6c04114dc3ebae9ad5db10.webm?t=1761569552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809560/extras/0d3fa4c20b6c04114dc3ebae9ad5db10.mp4?t=1761569552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Haunting, Handcrafted World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a bizarre interior landscape of a colossal beast. Every dripping detail and splatter tells a story waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809560/extras/6c03529a6080acd4e52f5cc63ad938e9.poster.avif?t=1