sion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 10 secrets. Can you find them all?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["IV Productions","Elan Manuguerra"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3560430","name":"Evolvania"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809560/459535a5c47f81dd61eb97e8655e7b61808d7d6b/header.jpg?t=1761569552","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3809560/1419984766/c27e5c4d7f92aaf0a6255f6b67cfe6b4287b26f1/1761323111/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761324113","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3809560/1419984766/c27e5c4d7f92aaf0a6255f6b67cfe6b4287b26f1/1761323111/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761324113","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3809560/1419984766/c27e5c4d7f92aaf0a6255f6b67cfe6b4287b26f1/1761323111/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761324113","id":257175801,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175801/movie480.mp4?t=1761324113","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175801/movie_max.mp4?t=1761324113"},"name":"Evolvania Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257175801/f46e7465d36f6bf5fd41e9c2e113fd09fd2b113d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761324113","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175801/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1761324113","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175801/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1761324113"}}],"name":"Evolvania Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo E5200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br>